{"id":"n71578-1-9","stage":1,"title":"짜다 · 咸","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71578-1-9-1","ko":"좀 싱거운데. 소금을 더 넣어야겠어.","zh":"有点淡啊。得再加点盐才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싱거운데.","meaning":"淡，清淡","explanation":"싱겁다：淡，清淡；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"싱겁다","audio":"/audio/8710536623905dfce5e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16472","senseId":"1","lemma":"싱겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소금을","meaning":"盐，咸盐","explanation":"소금：盐，咸盐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소금","audio":"/audio/3d09660e62955de5ce0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61167","senseId":"1","lemma":"소금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어야겠어.","meaning":"划入，加上列入","explanation":"넣다：划入，加上列入；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"3","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8710536623905dfc","term":"싱겁다","zh":"淡，清淡","audio":"/audio/8710536623905dfce5e1.mp3","entryId":"16472","definition":"食物的咸味少。","pronunciation":["싱겁따"]},{"id":"3d09660e62955de5","term":"소금","zh":"盐，咸盐","audio":"/audio/3d09660e62955de5ce0d.mp3","entryId":"61167","definition":"有咸味的白色粉末。","pronunciation":["소금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"划入，加上列入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个范围内。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2abe8ead237c98e46803.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71578-1-9-2","ko":"지금 간이 딱 맞아. 너는 너무 짜게 먹는 것 같아.","zh":"现在的味道刚好。你吃的东西好像太咸了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간이","meaning":"咸淡","explanation":"간：咸淡；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16203","senseId":"2","lemma":"간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딱","meaning":"正好，正","explanation":"딱：正好，正","readings":[{"term":"딱","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50537","senseId":"3","lemma":"딱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"合，合乎，对","explanation":"맞다：合，合乎，对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"6","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짜게","meaning":"咸","explanation":"짜다：咸；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짜다","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71578","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"74ca8db3a8d70490","term":"간","zh":"咸淡","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3","entryId":"16203","definition":"食物咸的程度。","pronunciation":["간"]},{"id":"c2f17f436a9934a6","term":"딱","zh":"正好，正","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3","entryId":"50537","definition":"数量、大小、情况等正确无误的样子。","pronunciation":["딱"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"合，合乎，对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"某种味道、温度或适度等正合适。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"2a62c1820e5f4c49","term":"짜다","zh":"咸","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3","entryId":"71578","definition":"味道和盐一样。","pronunciation":["짜다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"